# fireball.fmat — the same volumetric effect, turned all the way up.
#
# Dense, churning and emitting light of its own. Side by side with smoke.fmat it
# is a demonstration of what the eight numbers do, which is easier to learn from
# than a slider on its own.
kind: particle
doc: The hot core of an explosion. Ramp its emission down on the layer to cool it into smoke.
effects:
  - effect: blend_mode
    mode: additive
  - effect: volume
    density: 5
    noise_scale: 1.4
    displacement: 0.45
    billow: 0.8
    erosion: 0.15
    albedo: {r: 0.22, g: 0.2, b: 0.19}
    absorption: 1
    emission: 2.2
